      "voiceover": {
        "text": "Two exam questions. First. For people in rural and remote areas, a health service offers telehealth for chronic disease reviews, and a travel subsidy that's repaid after each trip. For each action, identify the part of the mechanism it attacks, and one situation where it wouldn't help. Pause here to answer."
