      "title": "attempt two (a free kit nobody returns)",
      "voiceover": {
        "text": "Second. Older people who recently migrated to Australia, many on low incomes, are mailed a free bowel screening kit with instructions only in English. Few kits are returned. Explain why it reaches so few, and suggest one change. Pause here to answer."
      },
      "durationInFrames": 1,
      "holdSeconds": 10,
