      "id": "feedback-two",
      "title": "feedback, item two",
      "voiceover": {
        "text": "The kit removes one barrier, cost, but leaves the others closed. English-only instructions close the language gate. An unfamiliar system, and no reason yet to trust it, close more. Each blocks the others' workarounds, so few kits come back. A change: translated instructions, and a bicultural health worker who explains it in person. The classic mistake is calling a free action accessible."
